NOTE 5 ‚Äì 
Acquisitions and Divestitures
ZT Systems Acquisition
On 
March 31, 2025
 (the Acquisition Date), the Company completed the acquisition of all issued and outstanding shares of ZT Systems for a total purchase consideration of $
4.4
 billion. ZT Systems is a provider of AI and general-purpose compute infrastructure for hyperscale computing companies. The acquisition is expected to enable the Company to deliver end-to-end AI solutions and accelerate the design and deployment of AMD-powered AI infrastructure at scale optimized for the cloud. 
