1,151,052
 shares of Sanmina common stock and $
2.4
 billion in cash, subject to certain purchase price adjustments. The Company is eligible to receive additional cash consideration of up to $
450
 million to the extent certain conditions are met following the close of the sale. 
On October 30, 2025, with the completion of the sale of the ZT Manufacturing Business, the Company settled the contingent consideration liability of $300 million in cash and 740,961 shares of the Company‚Äôs common stock with the former ZT Systems stockholders and warrant holders.23
