400
 million for cash transferred to Altera with the sale; an offset of approximately $
469
 million for separation and employee-related costs we have agreed to fund to SLP; and an offset for other direct and incremental costs incurred in connection with the sale.
As of March¬†28, 2026, the outstanding receivable from SLP was $
468
