Automotive Sales
Deferred revenue related to the access to our Full Self-Driving (‚ÄúFSD‚Äù) (Supervised) features and their ongoing maintenance, internet connectivity, free Supercharging programs and over-the-air software updates primarily on automotive sales amounted to $
3.83
 billion and $
3.60
 billion as of September¬†30, 2025 and December¬†31, 2024, respectively.
